---
title: Energy Bars
author: Jonathan Simmonds
cook time: 10 minutes
---

Melt @oil{120%ml}, @soft brown sugar{200%g}, @golden syrup{1%tbsp}, @peanut butter{1%tbsp}, and @vanilla extract{1%tsp} in a #pan{} over a low heat until mixed.

Add @sesame seeds{25%g}, @sunflower seeds{25%g}, @flaked almonds{50%g}(or @pecan halves{}), @sultanas{50%g}(or @chopped apricots{}), and @chopped dates{50%g} and stir together.

Gradually add the @oats{225g}. Press firmly into an 8" tin. Place in an oven at 180°C for ~{10%minutes}.
